<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Requirements Compliance Matrix</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 2rem; }
    table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; }
    th, td { border: 1px solid #bbb; padding: .55rem; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
    th { background: #eee; }
    .COMPLIANT { font-weight: bold; }
    .NON_COMPLIANT { font-weight: bold; }
    .REVIEW { font-weight: bold; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Requirements Compliance Matrix</h1>

<p>
Demo rule set: an APPROVED requirement is COMPLIANT when it has acceptance
criteria, at least one linked verification test, no validation errors, and all
linked test evidence is PASSED.
</p>

<table>
  <tr>
    <th>Requirement</th>
    <th>Title</th>
    <th>Status</th>
    <th>Acceptance Criteria</th>
    <th>Tests</th>
    <th>Test Result</th>
    <th>Validation Errors</th>
    <th>Compliance</th>
    <th>Rationale</th>
  </tr>
#foreach($entry in $entries)
  <tr>
    <td>$entry.requirementId()</td>
    <td>$entry.title()</td>
    <td>$entry.requirementStatus()</td>
    <td>$entry.acceptanceCriteriaCount()</td>
    <td>$entry.testIds()</td>
    <td>$entry.testSummary()</td>
    <td>$entry.validationErrors()</td>
    <td class="$entry.complianceStatus()">$entry.complianceStatus()</td>
    <td>$entry.rationale()</td>
  </tr>
#end
</table>
</body>
</html>
